{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29147","headline":"春早郡楼书事寄呈府中羣公 · 许浑","name":"春早郡楼书事寄呈府中羣公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两鬓垂丝髪半霜，石城孤梦绕襄阳。\n鸳鸿幕里莲披槛，虎豹营中柳拂墙。\n画舸欲行春水急，翠帘初卷暮山长。\n岘亭风起花千片，流入南湖尽日香。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29147.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29147","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}